{
  "name": "dsh-todo-float-ball",
  "version": "0.12.3",
  "description": "让 AI 的任务清单常驻眼前：悬浮球显示完成数/总数与进度环，点开看完整清单，支持多会话固定、胶囊模式、六款皮肤。| Keep the agent's todo list always visible: a draggable ball with live done/total and progress ring, expandable list, multi-session pins, six skins.",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "sideEffects": false,
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.zh.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "docs/*.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "docs/images/**"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-todo-float-ball.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-todo-float-ball#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-todo-float-ball/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "todo",
    "悬浮球",
    "float-ball",
    "task-list",
    "progress",
    "ui"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
